<title>USA: NUCO2 Inc year June 30 shr loss.</title>
<headline>NUCO2 Inc year June 30 shr loss.</headline>
<dateline>STUART, Fla. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr loss	    $0.01     loss	 $0.17</p>
<p> Oper net loss		 47     loss	   533</p>
<p> Revs			12,000		    6,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: During the year ended June 30, 1996, NUCO2 wrote off $785,000 of deferred financing costs and incurred $75,000 in prepayment penalties related to debt which was repaid with the proceeds of NUCO2's initial public offering in December 1995.</p>
<p>Net loss after extraordinary item for the year ended June 30, 1996 was $812,700 or $0.19 per share of common stock.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
